# Barrow Naughty: flying, and "lifelink as long as you control another Faerie". Bot1 casts two on turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Jet pay the
# four mana): each is "another Faerie" to the other, so both have flying and lifelink, and attacking on turn 3 deals 2 in the air while
# gaining 2 (Bot2 has no creatures to block).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Barrow Naughty
Barrow Naughty
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Barrow Naughty.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Barrow Naughty.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Barrow Naughty#1.Keywords = Flying; Lifelink
? Bot1.Battlefield.Barrow Naughty#2.Keywords = Flying; Lifelink
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Barrow Naughty#1 > Bot2; Barrow Naughty#2 > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Life = 22
